---
source: crates/daemon/src/firewall/pf.rs
expression: render(&golden_ruleset())
---
# always allowed (replies to outbound traffic match existing state)
pass quick on lo0 all
block drop in quick on ygg0 inet6 proto icmp6 icmp6-type 128
block drop in quick on ygg0 inet proto icmp icmp-type 8
block drop in quick on ygg0 proto udp from any port { 547, 67 } to any port { 546, 68 }
pass in quick inet6 proto icmp6 icmp6-type { 1, 2, 3, 4, 134, 135, 136 }
pass in quick inet6 proto icmp6 from fe80::/10 icmp6-type 130
pass in quick inet6 proto icmp6 icmp6-type 128
pass in quick inet proto icmp icmp-type { 3, 11, 12, 8 }
pass in quick inet6 proto udp from fe80::/10 port 547 to any port 546
pass in quick inet proto udp from any port 67 to any port 68
# rules
pass in quick on eth0 inet6 proto udp from any to fd00::9 port 53 keep state
pass in quick inet6 proto tcp from { fd00::10/128, fd00:5::/32 } to 301::1 port 8080 keep state
pass in quick on ygg0 inet6 proto tcp from { 200:1::5/128 } to 301::1 port 8080 keep state
pass in quick on eth0 inet proto tcp from { 198.51.100.0/24 } to 192.0.2.9 port 22 keep state
# scopes
block drop in log quick inet6 from any to { fd00::1, 301::1 }
block drop in log quick inet from any to { 192.0.2.9 }
block drop in log quick on ygg0 all
block drop in log quick on eth0 all
block drop in log quick on wlan0 inet6 all
